# Beyond assets/source/.gitignore: fittings is procedural, and its build writes these crops and masks from the
# finished layers, keeping its first round beside them.
tex/fittings/source/*.png
tex/fittings/source/pass*/
# The image model's run logs; its briefs and reports are kept.
artist-transcript*.txt
artist-last*.md
# The concept's every generation (the chosen ones are copied up beside DESIGN.md, and manifest.json keeps all their
# hashes), the guides and dimension sheet its scripts draw again, and the old renders it was shown.
ref/concept/source/generations/
ref/concept/source/guides/
ref/concept/source/dimensions.png
ref/concept/source/DESIGN.md
ref/concept/source/gallery.html
ref/concept/now/
